        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">estimated dismantling of the facilities of a chemical plant, assuming that only 50% of the metals can be recyled and the rest has - due to contamination reason - be landfilled.\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes the processes used for dismantling and disposal of the production facilities for chemicals per kg of the facilities. The included processes are: transport of metals from dismantling site to recycling / landfilling. Not included is the transport and the further treatment of concrete and rock woll (separate modules).; Geography: Data used has no specific geographical origin (assumptions).</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
